 "remarks": "WOW FACTOR RENOVATIONS! This stunning 2-bedroom, 2-bath corner condo at The Windemere has been beautifully transformed with high-end finishes throughout! Featuring a showstopping designer kitchen with Samsung appliances and a premium Miele oven, two fully renovated spa-inspired bathrooms, sleek recessed lighting, elegant wood accent walls, and custom-built closet systems. Enjoy a sun-filled open layout, city views, and in-unit laundry. Building amenities include a fitness center, BBQ terrace, pet-friendly living, and secure tandem garage parking for two cars. Conveniently located near trains, shopping, dining, and highways. Not your average condo-this one is a must-see! Schedule your private showing today.",
